// QuicBaaS Ceremony Protocol Buffer Definitions v1
// M-of-N initialization ceremony exposed by the QuicBaaS daemon.
//
// QuicBaaS itself does not own the ceremony; the embedded go-qrdb
// instance does. These RPCs are a thin gRPC facade that QuicBaaS exposes
// so that gRPC-only clients connecting to the QuicBaaS endpoint can drive
// ceremony operations against the composed stack. The shape mirrors the
